		border-radius: 0.375rem;
		background: white;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
		border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
	}

	.dropdown-header {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
